            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# SakuraCord v0.1.7-Beta-10.1

## SakuraCord v0.1.7 Beta 10.1 (macOS 26 port)

Unofficial macOS 26.5 build of SakuraCord nightly, put together by @UnxnownYT.

### Fixed
- The toolbar at the top of the window is now transparent like the rest of the app, instead of a solid grey bar. This had been there since the first macOS 26 build.

Everything else is the same as Beta 10. (Previous Update)

### Notes
- Ad-hoc signed. On first launch, right-click → Open (or allow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security).
- Updates: Check for Updates… uses the nightly feed.
- Will try to make the next nightly or newest update as fast as possible.
]]></description>
